  "rationale": "GEO holds the 229-peak secondary (validation) library, 5,718 guides over 249 elements (HOXA9-bound peaks, an RPS19 positive control and 20 negative-control guides), as sheet Raw.Count.tsv of the deposited workbook; the paper's ~1,800-peak primary screen is not deposited. The paper's MAGeCK comparisons (Meta.vs.list, Supplementary Data 2) are each arm's day 14 versus day 0, unpaired, 3 vs 3; we reproduce the SEM Cas9 (knockout) and SEM dCas9-KRAB (CRISPRi) day-14 comparisons, which the paper's FLT3-enhancer and CDK6-intron hits come from. Replicate residuals show no day-0/day-14 pairing, so no replicate term. MOLM13 is not in the paper's supplementary MAGeCK tables and is not analysed.",
